Package: rsrb-release
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Syntax-XXX <Syntax-XXX@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: base-files
Recommends: rsrb-neofetch
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Syntax-XXX/rsrb
Description: RSRB (RackStation ReBoot) system identity
 Brands a Debian 12 system as RSRB: /etc/os-release (ID=rsrb,
 ID_LIKE=debian, version stays 12/bookworm so tools keep working),
 the console login banner and a short login message.
 Debian's original files are kept aside with dpkg-divert and come back
 when the package is removed.
